Package: codelist
Type: Package
Title: Working with Code Lists
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Jan",
           family = "van der Laan",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "r@eoos.dds.nl",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0693-1514"))
Description: Make working with code lists easier in R. Defines a 'code' vector, 
    which is a vector with codes with an associated code list. Codes should be
    from this code list. A code list consists at minimum of a list of codes
    with corresponding labels. The 'code' vector is an alternative for factor.
    Methods allow for transforming between codes and labels. Also supports
    hierarchical code lists.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    utils,
    methods
